{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "Buon Natale: The Christmas Album and 12 Songs Of Christmas fit the holiday theme repeated across several of my past interactions; Buon Natale is the one I would try today.",
    "Advent At Ephesus also connects to my holiday listening, although I would need a sample to know whether its sound appeals to me."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Elvis: Ultimate Gospel does not follow naturally from my Christmas listening: interest in holiday music does not mean I want a full gospel collection or a particular artist.",
    "The country hits and relaxation flute collections serve listening interests I have not expressed, while Wicked Game, Heritage and Happy 2-Track give me no clear reason to choose them."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "The recommendations seem to stretch my interest in Christmas music into a broader interest in religious music.",
    "Some choices seem to treat music in general as enough of a connection, when I need a clearer link to the albums I have explored."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "Several holiday interactions happened together in November 2014, so they show a strong interest during that visit without proving that every later visit has the same purpose.",
    "A Christmas title makes an album relevant, but artist and sound still matter to whether I would choose it; I would only try one new album this visit."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "You recognized my repeated holiday interest, but stretched it toward unrelated music and left uncertainty about which albums would suit my listening now."
}"}
